# changes: NUL 로그를 정규화한 상태/경로 → 현재 파일의 rename 계보 · 같이 바뀜 · 근거 커밋
graph_awk_changes() {
  cat <<'AWKEOF'
BEGIN {
  while ((getline p < list) > 0) if (p != "" && !index(p, "\t")) { TR[p] = 1; ACTIVE[p] = p }
  close(list)
  PLIMIT = 20
}
/^\001/ {
  flush()
  if (NCOM >= maxc) { TRUNC = 1; IGNORE = 1; next }
  h = substr($0, 2); at = index(h, "\t"); CSHA = substr(h, 1, at - 1); h = substr(h, at + 1)
  at = index(h, "\t"); CDATE = substr(h, 1, at - 1); h = substr(h, at + 1)
  at = index(h, "\t"); CTIME = substr(h, 1, at - 1) + 0; CSUBJECT = substr(h, at + 1)
  next
}
/^\002/ { INVALID = substr($0, 2) + 0; next }
$0 != "" && !IGNORE {
  n = split($0, a, "\t"); status = substr(a[1], 1, 1); p = a[2]
  if (status == "R") {
    # 逆순: new 의 현재 파일 정체성을 old 로 옮긴다. 현재 이름을 재사용한 옛 파일과 섞이지 않게 new 를 닫는다.
    old = p; p = a[3]; id = ACTIVE[p]
    if (id != "") { addchange(id); MOVES[old] = id; NRENAME++ }
    else MOVES[old] = ""
    CLOSED[p] = 1
  } else if (status == "C") {
    p = a[3]; addchange(ACTIVE[p]); CLOSED[p] = 1      # 복사는 새 파일이며 원본 이력을 물려받지 않는다
  } else {
    if (status != "D") addchange(ACTIVE[p])
    if (status == "A" || status == "D") CLOSED[p] = 1
  }
}
END { flush(); changes_out() }
function addchange(p) {
  if (p == "" || !(p in TR) || !inscope(p) || (p in SEEN) || !langok(p)) return
  if (p ~ ENVIRON["GITSW_LOCKRE"]) { LOCKS[p] = 1; return }
  SEEN[p] = 1; FL[++NFC] = p
}
function flush(   i, j, x, y, t, k, p) {   # 큰 커밋도 rename 계보는 적용하고 통계/쌍에서만 뺀다
  if (CSHA != "") {
    NCOM++
    if (!HFROM || CTIME < HFROM) { HFROM = CTIME; HFROMDATE = CDATE }
    if (!HTO || CTIME > HTO) { HTO = CTIME; HTODATE = CDATE }
    if (NFC > maxf) NSKIP++
    else if (NFC > 0) {
      NUSED++
      if (!AFROM || CTIME < AFROM) { AFROM = CTIME; AFROMDATE = CDATE }
      if (!ATO || CTIME > ATO) { ATO = CTIME; ATODATE = CDATE }
      for (i = 1; i <= NFC; i++) {
        p = FL[i]; CH[p]++
        if (!(p in LASTTIME) || CTIME > LASTTIME[p]) { LASTTIME[p] = CTIME; LAST[p] = substr(CDATE, 1, 10) }
      }
      for (i = 1; i < NFC; i++) for (j = i + 1; j <= NFC; j++) {
        x = FL[i] ""; y = FL[j] ""
        if (x > y) { t = x; x = y; y = t }
        k = x "\034" y; PR[k]++
        if (PR[k] <= PLIMIT) PROOF[k] = PROOF[k] (PR[k] > 1 ? "," : "") "{\"sha\":" jstr(CSHA) ",\"date\":" jstr(CDATE) ",\"subject\":" jstr(CSUBJECT) "}"
      }
    }
    for (p in CLOSED) delete ACTIVE[p]
    for (p in MOVES) { if (MOVES[p] != "") ACTIVE[p] = MOVES[p]; else delete ACTIVE[p] }
  }
  CSHA = ""; NFC = 0; split("", SEEN); split("", CLOSED); split("", MOVES)
}
function changes_out(   k, a, c, f, g, extra) {
  for (k in PR) {
    c = PR[k]
    if (c < min) continue
    split(k, a, "\034")
    extra = "\"degree\":" int(200 * c / (CH[a[1]] + CH[a[2]]) + 0.5) ",\"method\":\"git-history\",\"commitCount\":" c ",\"commitsTruncated\":" (c > PLIMIT ? "true" : "false") ",\"commits\":[" PROOF[k] "]"
    addedge(a[1], a[2], "cochange", c, 0, "", extra)
    KEEP[a[1]] = 1; KEEP[a[2]] = 1
  }
  for (f in CH) {
    if (CH[f] < min && !(f in KEEP)) continue
    g = langof(f); if (g == "") g = tolower(extof(f)); if (g == "") g = "file"
    addnode(f, "file", baseof(f), g, "\"path\":" jstr(f) ",\"lang\":" jstr(g) ",\"changes\":" CH[f] ",\"lastChanged\":" jstr(LAST[f]))
  }
  emit()
  printf "0\tcommits\t%d\n0\tanalyzedCommits\t%d\n0\tskippedLargeCommits\t%d\n", NCOM, NUSED, NSKIP
  printf "0\tmaxCommits\t%d\n0\tmaxFiles\t%d\n0\tminCount\t%d\n0\tsince\t%s\n", maxc, maxf, min, (since == "" ? "null" : jstr(since))
  printf "0\thistoryFrom\t%s\n0\thistoryTo\t%s\n", (HFROMDATE == "" ? "null" : jstr(HFROMDATE)), (HTODATE == "" ? "null" : jstr(HTODATE))
  printf "0\tanalyzedFrom\t%s\n0\tanalyzedTo\t%s\n", (AFROMDATE == "" ? "null" : jstr(AFROMDATE)), (ATODATE == "" ? "null" : jstr(ATODATE))
  printf "0\thistoryTruncated\t%s\n0\tshallowHistory\t%s\n0\tfollowedRenames\t%d\n0\tprovenanceLimit\t%d\n0\tskippedHistoryPaths\t%d\n", (TRUNC ? "true" : "false"), (shallow == "true" ? "true" : "false"), NRENAME, PLIMIT, INVALID
  printf "0\tnote\t한 커밋에 같이 바뀐 파일 쌍입니다. weight = 같이 바뀐 커밋 수, degree = 두 파일이 바뀐 횟수 평균에 대한 비율(%%), 노드의 changes = 바뀐 횟수(핫스팟).\n"
